S[ally] Bells Kitchen is[ known] for their delicious boxed lunches. Items such as potato salad, chicken salad, tuna salad, dev[iled] eggs, cheese wafers and an array of cup cakes are made fresh from scratch daily. They sell thousands of sandwiches, cupcakes and hundreds of pounds of salads each year. This establishment is very welcoming, friendly and certainly has southern charm. The staff is just wonderful!

